# =====================================================================
#  SECRETS - never commit these
# =====================================================================
# The Vocareum API key lives in cosmic-mart/.env and is attached
# server-side by server.js. cosmic-mart/js/config.js is client-side
# only and holds no secret, so it IS committed - the site breaks
# without it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Credentials / keys of any kind
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.json
credentials.json

# =====================================================================
#  CONFIDENTIAL - withheld because the GitHub repo is PUBLIC
# =====================================================================
# COSMIC_MART_PROJECT_CONTEXT.md is stamped "APEX Cohort 2 | Accenture
# Internal" and contains the client financials and sentiment analysis
# from the brief. It stays on local disk and is shared out-of-band.
# If the repo is ever switched to Private, delete this line and commit
# the file so teammates get the full brief.
/COSMIC_MART_PROJECT_CONTEXT.md

# =====================================================================
#  Local-only, per-machine files
# =====================================================================
**/CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.server.log
*.log

# Editor / IDE personal settings
.vscode/
.idea/

# =====================================================================
#  Duplicated source art
# =====================================================================
# These three were dropped at the repo root, then copied into
# cosmic-mart/assets/planets/ which is what the site actually loads.
# Ignoring the root copies avoids committing ~3.9 MB twice. The files
# stay on disk locally.
/cosmic_planet_ringed.png
/cosmic_planet_earthlike.png
/cosmic_planet_asteroid.png

# =====================================================================
#  Dependencies & OS cruft
# =====================================================================
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
